      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ce7236/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-18T07:08:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I played ground pound with Mars base self destruct sequence out. According to the rules if you skip a turn you skip every phase of that turn, which would also mean the start of the turn when ground pound would be destroyed. So I could skip my turn every turn and heros would never take damage?&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Wanted to see if we just got a lucky combo or we miss something in the rules.</p>",
